    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "__expr__", "uid": "__expr__" },
      "description": "**O que mede:** fixa a identidade operacional selecionada na lista de itens doentes.\n\n**Como interpretar:** item, fila, tenant e RootOperationId delimitam a investigacao apresentada abaixo. Este painel ainda nao classifica causa de negocio ou tecnica.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "# Item de fila\n\n**Item:** `$item`  \n**Fila:** `$queue`  \n**Tenant:** `$tenant`  \n**RootOperationId:** `$root`\n\nAbaixo aparecem a evidencia que declarou a doenca, o historico operacional do item e os registros que possuem `trace_id` navegavel para o Tempo.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.2.3",
      "title": "1. Identidade do item",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "description": "**O que mede:** todas as mudancas de saude publicadas para o item selecionado dentro da retencao de cinco dias.\n\n**Como interpretar:** a linha mais recente representa a ultima doenca observada. Repeticoes indicam nova tentativa, alteracao de contador ou mudanca de estado; nao representam itens diferentes.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": { "cellHeight": "sm", "footer": { "countRows": false, "enablePagination": true, "fields": "", "reducer": ["sum"], "show": false }, "showHeader": true },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service\"} |= \"QueueItem.HealthChanged\" |= \"$item\" | json environment=\"Environment\", tenant_id=\"Data.TenantId\", queue_name=\"Data.Queue\", item_type=\"Data.ItemType\", item_reference=\"Data.ItemReference\", disease=\"Data.Disease\", severity=\"Data.Severity\", execution_count=\"Data.ExecutionCount\", retry_count=\"Data.RetryCount\", last_outcome=\"Data.LastOutcome\", root_operation_id=\"Data.RootOperationId\", error_signature=\"Data.ErrorSignature\" | environment=~\"$environment\" | line_format \"{{.tenant_id}}|{{.queue_name}}|{{.item_type}}|{{.item_reference}}|{{.disease}}|{{.severity}}|{{.execution_count}}|{{.retry_count}}|{{.last_outcome}}|{{.root_operation_id}}|{{.error_signature}}\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "timeFrom": "5d",
      "title": "2. Evidencias de saude deste item",
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "extractFields", "options": { "format": "regexp", "keepTime": true, "regexp": "(?<TenantId>[^|]*)\\|(?<Queue>[^|]*)\\|(?<ItemType>[^|]*)\\|(?<ItemReference>[^|]*)\\|(?<Disease>[^|]*)\\|(?<Severity>[^|]*)\\|(?<ExecutionCount>[^|]*)\\|(?<RetryCount>[^|]*)\\|(?<LastOutcome>[^|]*)\\|(?<RootOperationId>[^|]*)\\|(?<ErrorSignature>[^|]*)", "replace": true, "source": "Line" } }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "description": "**O que mede:** narrativa cronologica completa do item, incluindo Commands, Saga, Steps, Inbox, Outbox e a evidencia de saude que contenham a mesma referencia.\n\n**Como interpretar:** leia de baixo para cima quando a ordenacao estiver decrescente. Localize o ultimo `StepStarted` sem conclusao e o primeiro evento `Failed` ou `RetryScheduled`.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 14, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": { "dedupStrategy": "none", "enableLogDetails": true, "prettifyLogMessage": true, "showCommonLabels": false, "showLabels": true, "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service\"} |= \"$item\" | json environment=\"Environment\" | environment=~\"$environment\"", "queryType": "range", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "timeFrom": "5d",
      "title": "3. Historico operacional do item",
      "type": "logs"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "description": "**O que mede:** somente registros do item que possuem `trace_id`.\n\n**Como interpretar:** cada registro representa uma tentativa tecnica rastreavel. Expanda o registro, localize o campo `trace_id` e use o link derivado **Trace** para abrir o trace correspondente no Tempo.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 14, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 13 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": { "dedupStrategy": "none", "enableLogDetails": true, "prettifyLogMessage": true, "showCommonLabels": false, "showLabels": true, "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service\"} |= \"$item\" | json environment=\"Environment\" | environment=~\"$environment\" | trace_id=~\".+\"", "queryType": "range", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "timeFrom": "5d",
      "title": "4. Tentativas com trace no Tempo",
      "type": "logs"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "tags": ["yeshua", "observability", "queue-item", "macro-to-micro"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "allValue": ".*",
